            "review_title": "Review at Juiffee 'n' Poki",
            "review_text": "65laml\n1 contribution\n0\n⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ – Great food & service!\nFeb 2025 • Solo\nAmazing!!!\nJuiffee ‘n’ Poki is a fantastic spot for fresh and healthy poke bowls. The ingredients are super fresh, the flavors are well-balanced, and the juices are refreshing. The staff is friendly and attentive, and the space is cozy and inviting. Definitely a must-try in Ho Chi Minh City! I’ll be back for sure!\nWritten February 18, 2025",
